  "content": "<h1><img src=\"https://cdn-raw.modrinth.com/data/6uJCfiCH/0b4983e0ba8cac6ffe2cc5c2076a8a6b0b28fd1f.png\" alt=\"Spooklementary 标志\" width=\"60\" height=\"auto\"> &nbsp; Spooklementary</h1><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"静态徽章\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/discord-white?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=rgb(210, 106, 6)&amp;label=加入&amp;labelColor=rgb(4, 11, 20)&amp;color=rgb(210, 106, 6)\">\n</a>\n&nbsp;\n<img alt=\"静态徽章\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/iris, optifine, oculus | 1.7.10 至最新版-white?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;label=支持版本&amp;labelColor=rgb(4, 11, 20)&amp;color=rgb(210, 106, 6)\">\n&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/SpacEagle17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"静态徽章\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/spaceagle17-white?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=rgb(210, 106, 6)&amp;label=赞助&amp;labelColor=rgb(4, 11, 20)&amp;color=rgb(210, 106, 6)&amp;link=https://patreon.com/spaceagle17\">\n</a></p><h2>什么是 Spooklementary？</h2><ul>\n<li>Spooklementary，由 SpacEagle17 制作，是基于 EminGT 的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.complementary.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary 光影包</a> 的修改版。</li>\n<li>它是一款恐怖主题的光影包，能将你的游戏转变为充满阴森和惊悚氛围的体验。</li>\n<li>万圣节或恐怖地图的完美搭配！点击页面顶部的“画廊”查看截图。</li>\n</ul><p><strong>重要提示：请勿向 Emin 报告此附加组件相关的任何错误，请通过 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 向我报告。</strong></p><h2>相关链接</h2><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/SpacEagle17\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7f94a4d0b4854a694e1b3dbb5aa8e42fc15bce89.png\" alt=\"Patreon 赞助页面\">\n    <br><br>\n  </a>\n</div><ul>\n<li>SpacEagle17 的 <strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Discord</ins></a></strong> 服务器，用于讨论、提问、建议等。</li>\n<li>在 <strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/SpacEagle17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Twitter/X</ins></a></strong> 上关注 SpacEagle17，获取光影包的最新消息。</li>\n</ul><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:655px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CndrX1R5boQ\" width=\"455\" height=\"384\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></div><h2>由 Ember Host 赞助</h2><p>正在寻找价格实惠且可靠的 Minecraft 服务器托管？Ember Host 提供超值服务和顶级支持！</p><p>点击横幅或在结账时使用优惠码 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EUPHORIA</a></strong> 即可享受首次购买 <strong>10%</strong> 的折扣。此外，您消费金额的 <strong>70%</strong> 将用于支持 Euphoria Patches！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/545bcc6a4800cae3bace3a58a06e0dab9eccf9e4_0.webp\"></a></p>",
